    <innerclass refid="class_progress_bar" prot="public">ProgressBar</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Lightweight textual progress bar utility for console output. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file defines the <ref refid="class_progress_bar" kindref="compound">ProgressBar</ref> class, which displays a textual progress bar that updates as a process advances. It is intended for tracking iterations over a sequence or tasks in console-based environments. </para>
